{"book":"jeremiah","num":3,"verses":[{"en":"They say, If a man put away his wife, and she go from him, and become another man's, shall he return unto her again? shall not that land be greatly polluted? but thou hast played the harlot with many lovers; yet return again to me, saith the LORD.","n":1,"sm":"Fai mai, Afai e molia e se tagata lana aya, ma ua alu ese O ia ia te ia, a e fai ma aya a se tasi, e toe alu atu ea o ia ia te ia? E le matuā leaga ai ea lena nuu? A o oe, ua e talitane i tane e toatele, a ia e toe foi mai ia te au, ua fetalai ma ai le ALII.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"Afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"molia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"aya,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"aya"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia?"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"matuā"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"lena"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu?"},{"en":"","sm":"A"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oe,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"talitane"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"tane"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toatele,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetalai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en